### Species - Create Species (Success)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/species
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scientificName": "Nombre científico diferente 2",
  "commonNames": [
    "Pino carrasco",
    "Pino de Alepo"
  ],
  "description": "Especie arbórea de la familia de las pináceas.",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/pino.jpg"
}

### Species - Create Species (Validation Error)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/species
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scientificName": "",
  "commonNames": [
    "Test"
  ],
  "description": "Descripción muy corta",
  "imageUrl": null
}

### Species - Create Species (Conflict - Duplicate)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/species
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scientificName": "Pinus halepensis",
  "commonNames": [
    "Otro nombre"
  ],
  "description": "Misma especie, diferente descripción",
  "imageUrl": null
}

### Species - Get Species
GET {{host}}/api/v1/species/3
Content-Type: application/json

### Species - Get Species (Species Not-Found)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/species/1999
Content-Type: application/json

### Campaign - Get Campaign
GET {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Campaign - Get Campaign (Campaign Not-Found)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/1999
Content-Type: application/json

### Campaign - Get Species (Bad request)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/-3
Content-Type: application/json